<title>NETHERLANDS: WERELDHAVE CONFIRMS 1996 NET RESULT.</title>
<headline>WERELDHAVE CONFIRMS 1996 NET RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Direct inv. result (net profit) 121.5 vs 113.3</p>
<p>ditto per shr (guilders)	   7.55 vs   7.42</p>
<p>Total investment income	  185.8  vs 185.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment fund Wereldhave NV said in</p>
<p>January it expected a 1996 net of about 121.5 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  7.25 vs   7.25</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    50.4  vs  57.0</p>
<p>    Operating costs		     13.8  vs  14.7</p>
<p>    Tax					0.1  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Indirect result</p>
<p>    (property revaluation)    gain  118.6  vs 122.2 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Wereldhave said the 1996 dividend could be taken up</p>
<p>in cash or in new Wereldhave shares. Details of the 1996</p>
<p>optional stock dividend will be published on March 14.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
